\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. The homeland! the homeland! 
\par The land of the free- born;
\par There's no night in the homeland,
\par But aye the fadeless morn;
\par I'm sighing for the homeland,
\par My heart is aching here;
\par There's no pain in the homeland,
\par To which I'm drawing near.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. My Lord is in the homeland,
\par With angels bright and fair;
\par There's no sin in the homeland,
\par And no temptation there;
\par The voices of the homeland
\par Are ringing in my ears,
\par And when I think of the homeland,
\par My eyes are filled with tears.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. For those I love in the homeland
\par Are calling me away
\par To the rest and peace of the homeland,
\par And the life beyond decay:
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par For there's no death in the homeland,
\par There is no grief above:
\par Christ bring us  all to the homeland
\par Of His eternal love.
\par                    Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

